# The one SDK image every C# step runs in: unit tests, fixture build. The digest, not the tag, is the pin
# (cleat#4077, WS-cleat2's PINS.md). PR 2 owns the full toolchain lock (feeds, package versions, wasi-sdk hash);
# this file only names the container so the two scripts in this package cannot drift from each other.
CLEAT_CS_SDK_IMAGE=mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:10.0@sha256:fe0fd4e93bd2fbb47c883b7a6369e5c8d3db8bf01cdc5981f6ee35fbdf3ff4fb
